10 ways you’re accidentally training women to disrespect you 👇

1. You over-explain yourself, trying to prove your point instead of standing on it.

2. You say “yes” when you want to say “no.”

3. You chase her attention instead of earning her respect.

4. You tolerate flakiness because you’re afraid to lose her.

5. You apologize for things that don’t need an apology.

6. You keep trying to “fix” her behavior instead of walking away.

7. You let attraction make you forget your standards.

8. You reward mixed signals with more effort.

9. You over-invest emotionally before she’s earned it.

10. You mistake being “nice” for being respected.

Respect isn’t demanded, it’s taught by your actions. ⚜️
